><value
><text
>NOTICE: If you have a child from this relationship, the court is required to order child support based upon the income of both parents. Support normally continues until the child is 18. You should supply the court with information about your finances. Otherwise, the child support order will be based upon information supplied by the other parent. Any party required to pay child support must pay interest on overdue amounts at the "legal" rate, which is currently 10 percent.</text
></value
><ui
><textEdit
/></ui
><para vAlign="middle"
/><font weight="bold" size="9pt" typeface="Arial"
><fill
